Bundled filter data
-------------------
extension/rules/*.json and extension/data/cosmetic.js are generated from the
filter lists below, at the exact commits recorded in lists.config.json and
extension/data/lists-info.json. Each list keeps its own license:

* EasyList — https://easylist.to — dual licensed GPLv3 / CC BY-SA 3.0.
  Credit: The EasyList authors.
* Liste FR — https://github.com/easylist/listefr — CC BY-SA 3.0.
  Credit: The Liste FR authors.
* ABPVN List — https://abpvn.com — GPLv3.
  Credit: ABPVN.

The converted data is redistributed under those same licenses
(CC BY-SA 3.0 for EasyList and Liste FR, GPLv3 for ABPVN). GoGoChay's own
